Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.58,0:00:24.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,As long as there are people\Nwho seek freedom in this life,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.02,0:00:27.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,these things shall not\Nvanish from the earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.00,0:01:02.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,To follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.62,0:01:05.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I won't stop till I\Nget there, you will see!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.66,0:01:08.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I need to have\Nthe strength to believe.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.94,0:01:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Believe in wonderland!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.88,0:01:21.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna follow my dreams,\Nhowever crazy they seem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.20,0:01:24.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna share them\Nwith you, a love so true.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.24,0:01:27.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're all I want.\NTogether we can move on.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.66,0:01:29.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live how we want to.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:32.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There is no limit to us!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.12,0:01:33.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have the power of love.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.62,0:01:36.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't want to live ordinary lives.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.70,0:01:39.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have a chance to live in paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:39.76,0:01:42.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We live in one another.
Dialogue: 1,0:01:50.01,0:01:53.68,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\fad(900,0)\3c&H2A2A2A&\c&H2A2A2A&\1a&HFF&\t(855,900,\1a&H00&)}Showdown at Alubarna
Dialogue: 2,0:01:50.01,0:01:53.68,Title-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur0.5\fad(900,0)\c&HE6E6E6&\4a&HFF&}Showdown at Alubarna
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.66,0:01:58.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And that's when it happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.84,0:02:02.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I looked him straight in the eye\Nand yelled, "You bowlegged bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.74,0:02:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And ever since that day,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.50,0:02:09.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,crabs throughout the world have been\Nself-conscious about being bow-legged.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.48,0:02:11.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that's the reason they walk sideways?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.20,0:02:14.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yep, and at that pivotal moment?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.16,0:02:15.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A lobster happened to be within earshot.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.90,0:02:17.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and heard the whole thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.62,0:02:18.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.12,0:02:20.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So lobsters are crabs, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.08,0:02:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Better believe it. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.84,0:02:26.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro, why don't you relax?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.48,0:02:28.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you're just wasting your\Nenergy doing that who
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.90,0:02:33.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,asked you excuse him no\Nhe's hopeless guys like
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.28,0:02:35.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Zoro they got to keep\Nmoving or they won't stay
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.34,0:02:37.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,focused they have one-track
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.42,0:02:42.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,minds especially our own
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.52,0:02:44.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,resident muscle freak here\Nnow that he's had a taste
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.90,0:02:49.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of the seven warlords stop\Nwhining just say what's
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.24,0:02:52.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,on your mind or shut up\Nyou need me to spell it
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.06,0:02:56.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out all this tough guy\Nbluster is just a sad attempt.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.44,0:02:58.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to mask your fear that\Nluffy might lose this one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.90,0:03:02.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,who me you say i'm scared\Nhuh is that what you're
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.90,0:03:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,saying look at me fancy\Neyebrows that's it i've had
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.98,0:03:10.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,enough of you you damn\Nmoss head would you call me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.94,0:03:16.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you want to go at it cut\Nit out this is pointless
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.82,0:03:21.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,look at them they're at each\Nother's throats everyone's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.84,0:03:24.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,worked up it's up to me\Nas vice captain to take
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.52,0:03:28.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,charge calm down All of you\Neveryone's frightened. Yes,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.08,0:03:33.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but we mustn't turn on each other Luffy's\Ncounting on us to meet him in Alubarna.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.64,0:03:36.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, well, you see more\Non edge than any of us
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.02,0:03:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep your mind on the rebellion\Nand leave the rest to us
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.96,0:03:46.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sorry about that VV we tear each\Nother apart. We've already lost
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.54,0:03:51.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, that's settled now let's\Ndevote our attention to Alubarna
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.22,0:03:57.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scissors?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.24,0:03:58.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Name for the crab. Oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.48,0:04:00.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You just baked that up?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.82,0:04:01.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Got something better?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.02,0:04:02.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not really.
Dialogue: 1,0:04:05.48,0:04:10.27,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\bord2.75\fad(950,0)\3c&H040404&\c&HE6E6E5&\1a&HFF&\t(905,950,\1a&H00&)\pos(720,783)}Yuba\NFormer Rebel Base Camp
Dialogue: 2,0:04:05.48,0:04:10.27,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\bord0\fad(950,0)\c&HE7E6E6&\4a&HFF&\pos(720,783)}Yuba\NFormer Rebel Base Camp
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.52,0:04:13.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.62,0:04:15.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can hardly believe my eyes!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.46,0:04:18.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Precious water!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.04,0:04:22.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The water is coming forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.52,0:04:30.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Earth!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.43,0:04:31.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you, Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.38,0:04:33.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This land is strong!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.10,0:04:35.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Through it all, Yuba lives on!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.72,0:04:45.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sandstorm will deal Yuba\Na final destructive blow,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:45.72,0:04:50.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,banning the flames of anger within the\Nrebel army until an inferno ignites.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.30,0:04:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But in the end, the bleeding hearts which\Ninfest this land are what's killing it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.90,0:05:03.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And you, Straw Hat Luffy,\Nare the worst of them all.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.06,0:05:06.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If only you had purged\Nyourself of such weakness,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.22,0:05:09.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,you may have lived a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.12,0:05:11.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Water.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.68,0:05:17.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I assume you don't feel so\Nindebted to this water now.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.12,0:05:33.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's this? You're still alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.72,0:05:57.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That looks like it hurts, but you'll\Nbe out of your misery soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.98,0:06:06.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.86,0:06:15.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That was a complete waste of my time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.78,0:06:31.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not so bad once we've\Nweathered this storm. The
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.56,0:06:34.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,rain will bless us with\Nsweet relief just like!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.78,0:06:41.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Always your winds will\Nnever vanquish us you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.38,0:06:45.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Cowardly storm? You but\Nwill never give in to the?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.62,0:06:57.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Me? Go to Alubarna?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.76,0:07:03.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we chasing after the Straw Hat Pirates\Nor, uh, reinforcing the Royal Army?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.74,0:07:06.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's up to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:06.70,0:07:10.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You'll have to decide which is\Nmore important when you get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.62,0:07:12.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But, sir, I don't understand.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.64,0:07:13.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.44,0:07:17.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rely on your sense of justice.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.58,0:07:21.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever happens, I'll\Naccept responsibility.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.00,0:07:24.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Captain, where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.62,0:07:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to head out to sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.14,0:07:27.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Something unforeseen has come up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.80,0:07:31.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be on alert to receive\Ncommunication from me at any time.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.16,0:07:31.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.60,0:07:36.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I need you to keep a vigilant eye on\Nthis country and where it ends up.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.22,0:07:41.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether it falls or whether it survives,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.74,0:07:45.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the dawn of a brand new and\Nhistoric age is on the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.74,0:07:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sergeant Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:54.66,0:07:55.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sergeant Major!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.64,0:07:57.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your orders. Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.06,0:08:02.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whether it falls or whether it survives,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.58,0:08:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the dawn of a brand new and\Nhistoric age is on the horizon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.10,0:08:17.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our target is the pirate Straw Hat\NLuffy and everyone who serves under him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.94,0:08:19.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All hands, reinforce your gear.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.94,0:08:22.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare to depart for Alubarna. Right!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.26,0:08:25.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Straw Hat Luffy.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.16,0:08:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn you, Cobra.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.68,0:08:39.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My brethren and I are\Nwilling to defend Alabasta
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.20,0:08:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with every last drop\Nof blood in our bodies.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.40,0:08:43.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will die before turning it over to you.
Dialogue: 1,0:08:47.42,0:08:52.34,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(800,0)\bord0\c&HFBFBFC&\fs105\fsp0\fnAsul\b700\blur0.9\pos(720,769)}Alubarna, the Capital
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.36,0:08:53.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.27,0:08:54.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Step lively!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.20,0:08:55.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stop dawdling around and focus!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.06,0:08:58.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need more cannonballs over here!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.50,0:09:02.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chaka!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.68,0:09:06.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy's number is said\Nto be well over two million.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.42,0:09:11.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell me, soldier, what do you think\Nof His Majesty's attack on Nanohana?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.98,0:09:16.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have served his majesty for over\Nten years, and I was quite surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.52,0:09:17.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're right.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.43,0:09:20.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's really no way\Nanyone could rationalize it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.44,0:09:23.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Logic would suggest something\Nhas happened to the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.84,0:09:29.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If true, it is all the more reason\Nwhy we must not lose this fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.66,0:09:35.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bury your fear deep, for your king's\Nsake, as well as that of Princess Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.88,0:09:38.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will defend this country at all costs.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.60,0:09:43.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone who is not prepared to\Nfight, take shelter outside the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.16,0:09:46.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We cannot guarantee your safety\Nif you would like to stay.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.68,0:09:50.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If we don't get out of here,\Nwe'll be in the line of fire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.14,0:09:53.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Banks are getting hectic\Ndown there, I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:54.32,0:09:55.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But it's still moving too slow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.04,0:09:57.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and fight already.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.38,0:09:58.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't stand waiting.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:04.04,0:10:05.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't take this.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.30,0:10:07.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I really don't care if\Nhe is or isn't the king.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.24,0:10:10.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I've got to go out of my mind if I have\Nto stand here guarding him any longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:10.98,0:10:11.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't! Can't!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.94,0:10:12.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't take this!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:15.40,0:10:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, sure,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.44,0:10:19.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,slipping past the palace guards and\Nkidnapping this royal pain in the rear
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.44,0:10:22.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is a mission which only a team of\Nour accomplished skills can pull off.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.38,0:10:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But now that it's over, this\Nassignment has become a tedious bore!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:25.86,0:10:26.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Right, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.77,0:10:27.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.69,0:10:30.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did anything I said manage to seep\Nthrough that thick head of yours?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.84,0:10:32.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Slow, you're so slow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.18,0:10:34.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ugh, my back is killing me!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.92,0:10:38.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chaka, Koza, you mustn't fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.78,0:10:41.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The two of you embody the\Nspirit of this great country.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.94,0:10:44.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Divided, you only weaken her resolve.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:46.18,0:10:48.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are those who lament war.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.50,0:10:56.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And those who race towards it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.34,0:11:06.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just go ahead and run away! Ooh!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.40,0:11:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Still, others incite war.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.52,0:11:17.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But for the very few who know the\Ntruth, they strive to prevent it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.16,0:11:21.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,These widely opposing viewpoints\Nall have one thing in common.
