Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.98,0:11:32.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.89,0:11:34.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What do you mean we\Ncan't cross this river?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.82,0:11:35.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.78,0:11:37.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Moving crabs are creatures of the desert.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.52,0:11:38.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They don't take to water.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.66,0:11:40.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Has everyone gone nuts?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.32,0:11:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a crab!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.60,0:11:43.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They can exist on land and water!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.46,0:11:45.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guys, this is not good.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.10,0:11:47.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is a serious problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.44,0:11:48.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Look,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.35,0:11:50.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if we just carelessly spend our\Nenergy swimming across the river,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.00,0:11:52.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we're not gonna make it in time.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.48,0:11:53.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See here?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.39,0:11:55.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After the river, there's\Ntons of desert to deal with.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.76,0:11:58.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So if this crab can't make\Nit to the other shore,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.08,0:12:00.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,are we supposed to run the\Nrest of the way on foot?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:00.60,0:12:01.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We don't have a choice.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:01.90,0:12:03.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We won't make it in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.74,0:12:05.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's absolutely impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.96,0:12:13.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh-oh.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.04,0:12:15.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, I can see it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.50,0:12:17.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sandora River, straight ahead!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.20,0:12:18.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, great!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.11,0:12:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Help us, Scissors, pretty please!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.24,0:12:21.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.34,0:12:23.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Scissors loves dancer girls!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.76,0:12:27.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Will this do? Probably.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.56,0:12:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa, I can't take it! Oh!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.84,0:12:33.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's looking this way!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.82,0:12:37.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're accelerating!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.76,0:12:38.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This one!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.56,0:12:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Great, now we've got two animals in heat!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.02,0:12:47.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, we're moving now!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:48.98,0:12:52.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And what exactly has this\Nsolved, Chopper? Nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.92,0:13:08.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm seeing it, but I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.16,0:13:09.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This crab is incredible.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.52,0:13:11.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Way to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.80,0:13:12.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now don't you stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.82,0:13:13.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just keep on going.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:14.42,0:13:16.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry, run, run, run all the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.02,0:13:17.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.93,0:13:18.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.86,0:13:20.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing can stop us now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.22,0:13:21.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, I love this crab.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.40,0:13:22.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, wait a minute.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.56,0:13:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.47,0:13:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I didn't know better,\NI'd think we were sick!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.14,0:13:32.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You stupid crab!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.00,0:13:33.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's over.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.96,0:13:35.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No use whining about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.44,0:13:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:36.88,0:13:37.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a second.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.10,0:13:40.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure there aren't\Nany boats around here?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.16,0:13:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How long will it take\Nus to reach the shore?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.12,0:13:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest of the night.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.40,0:13:44.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's insane!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.78,0:13:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.46,0:13:49.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks for the ride!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.62,0:13:51.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye, sister! Oh, shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.48,0:13:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's the reason we're in this mess!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.18,0:14:01.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's a Sandoran catfish!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.04,0:14:03.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're rarely seen by humans!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.78,0:14:05.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Doesn't seem that rare to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.68,0:14:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did I mention they love\Nto eat human flesh?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.16,0:14:11.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could've told us a bit sooner!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.30,0:14:21.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get off of me, dammit!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.90,0:14:22.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can't see a thing with you!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.90,0:14:24.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm hanging on so tight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.06,0:14:34.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kong Fu to gums?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.26,0:14:38.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They say they were just looking\Nout for their fellow pupils.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.42,0:14:39.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pupils?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.33,0:14:41.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, they think Luffy's\Nour master? Please.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.94,0:14:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really want to argue with them?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.44,0:14:44.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, little guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.78,0:14:46.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just a little further!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.70,0:14:47.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thanks a lot!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.38,0:14:49.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Bye-bye!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.44,0:14:54.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that things are going\Nsmoothly can we make it
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.62,0:14:58.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,in time i don't know even\Nriding eyelash i'm not
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.12,0:15:00.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sure when we would get\Nthere not to be pessimistic
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.72,0:15:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but eyelash can only\Ncarry two of us if baroque
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.18,0:15:05.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,works is going to attack\Nus it'll be from here on
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.20,0:15:07.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,so we can't split up isn't\Nthere any way for us to
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.04,0:15:08.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,stick together
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.95,0:15:15.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,what
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.96,0:15:19.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,is it
Dialogue: 0,0:15:19.58,0:15:20.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,now is it the enemy don't
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.06,0:15:26.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,tell me they're here to\Nkill us already no wait
Dialogue: 1,0:15:29.03,0:15:34.12,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\bord2.75\fad(900,0)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(855,900,\1a&H00&)\pos(720,715.4)}Squadron Leader Karoo\NSupersonic Duck Squad\N(Swiftest Unit in Arabasta)
Dialogue: 2,0:15:29.03,0:15:34.12,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\bord0\fad(900,0)\c&HE4E6E6&\4a&HFF&\pos(720,715.4)}Squadron Leader Karoo\NSupersonic Duck Squad\N(Swiftest Unit in Arabasta)
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.24,0:15:39.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaido! Kaido! Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.24,0:15:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.14,0:16:02.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Kaido!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.88,0:16:17.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We may both be pirates, but you\Nfall grossly short on skill.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.44,0:16:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This sandstorm will deal Yuba\Na final destructive blow,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:22.82,0:16:27.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,banning the flames of anger within\Nthe until an inferno ignites.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.54,0:17:16.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.70,0:17:23.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why do you fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.42,0:17:31.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those of you with the name of D.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.84,0:17:34.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,D.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:37.16,0:17:38.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who are you, people?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.88,0:17:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are your intentions?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.46,0:17:45.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Apparently, you don't have a\Nclue what I'm talking about.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.88,0:17:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.70,0:17:59.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where is Vivi?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.90,0:18:00.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.94,0:18:03.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Awake already.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:04.36,0:18:09.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now that I've studied your ability, this\Nwon't turn out like it did last time.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.92,0:18:12.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Be careful, pal.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.96,0:18:14.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't want to overexert yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.94,0:18:24.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perfect timing. Why don't you\Nsave the boy before he dies?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.58,0:18:31.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all if it weren't for his\Ncourage and selflessness who knows
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.72,0:18:35.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,if your precious princess would\Nhave made it back alive at all it
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.40,0:18:39.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must please you to know Vivi's safe.\NThat even as we speak, she's on
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.10,0:18:42.27,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\bord2.75\fad(900,0)\pos(720,585)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(855,900,\1a&H00&)}Accelegator\NThe Second Fastest\NAnimal in Arabasta
Dialogue: 2,0:18:38.10,0:18:42.27,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\bord0\c&HE4E6E6&\fad(900,0)\pos(720,585)\4a&HFF&}Accelegator\NThe Second Fastest\NAnimal in Arabasta
Dialogue: 1,0:18:38.10,0:18:42.27,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\bord2.75\fad(900,0)\fscy230\pos(720,593)\c&H000000&\1a&HFF&\t(855,900,\1a&H00&)}(                                )
Dialogue: 2,0:18:38.10,0:18:42.27,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur0.5\bord0\c&HE4E6E6&\fad(900,0)\fscy230\pos(720,593)\4a&HFF&}(                                )
Dialogue: 0,0:18:39.74,0:18:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,her way to Alubarna though it's a\Nlong trip and anything could happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.20,0:18:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess the situation is what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.70,0:19:02.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I'm not able to stop her, then who can?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.66,0:19:05.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi must be protected\Nfor everyone's sake!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:09.60,0:19:10.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need meat!
Dialogue: 1,0:19:12.71,0:19:17.30,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fad(250,550)\b700\pos(720,761)\bord0\c&HFDFEFD&\fnAsul\blur0.9\fs105\fsp0}Nanohana, a Port Town
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.14,0:19:15.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, the final revolt has begun.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.22,0:19:17.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There was a lone ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.74,0:19:19.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hopefully that means\NPrincess Vivi and the others
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.04,0:19:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,were able to make it to\NAlabasta in one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.94,0:19:23.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I must hurry.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.38,0:19:26.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I pray there's still time.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.58,0:19:28.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:29.12,0:19:30.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you alright?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.26,0:19:31.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Need meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:35.44,0:19:36.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.12,0:19:37.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.34,0:19:39.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't need food now.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.16,0:19:42.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's the least of your worries. Hang on.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:42.70,0:19:44.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get a doctor for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.30,0:19:52.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to make sure\NCrocodile pays for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.70,0:20:00.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He insulted Phoebe, and that old\Nman with the shovel gave me water.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.74,0:20:03.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He's definitely gonna pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.32,0:20:07.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Who is this person?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.48,0:20:10.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meat.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.68,0:20:33.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.76,0:20:36.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's still in the distance,\Nbut it's Alubarna!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.36,0:20:40.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koza, we're less than\N30 minutes away! Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.20,0:20:43.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're nearing Alubarna now!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.90,0:20:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The time has come, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.40,0:20:53.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Chaka, we've sighted the rebel army.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:53.44,0:20:55.10,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're about ten miles to the south.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.18,0:20:58.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Their forces are bearing down on\Nthe southern gate as we speak.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.82,0:21:02.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,East, west, south, southeast, southwest!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.72,0:21:04.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Guard each gate with your life!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.76,0:21:09.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not let even one of them set\Nfoot within our walls! Right!
Dialogue: 1,0:21:20.51,0:21:26.52,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\blur1.5\fad(0,1800)\3c&H222222&\c&H222222&\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\b0\fsp2.25\bord4\pos(720,767.8)\t(4210,4255,\1a&HFF&)\t(4930,6010,0.3,\bord2)}{Alubarna: West Gate -OG}West Gate, Alubarna{Ravenfire}
Dialogue: 2,0:21:20.51,0:21:26.52,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur1\fad(0,1800)\c&HFAFCFB&\4a&HFF&\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\pos(720,767.8)\b0\fsp2.25\t(4210,6010,0.1,\1a&HFF&)}{Alubarna: West Gate -OG}West Gate, Alubarna{Ravenfire}
Dialogue: 3,0:21:20.51,0:21:26.52,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\bord0\blur1\fad(0,1800)\c&HFAFCFB&\4a&HFF&\fnDFPGiHi-W7-Strp\pos(720,767.8)\b0\fsp2.25}{Alubarna: West Gate -OG}West Gate, Alubarna{Ravenfire}
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.04,0:21:26.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, take a look over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.14,0:21:30.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rebel army is approaching,\Nand there are so many of them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.00,0:21:34.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The princess is such a little\Nidiot to think she can stop them.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.58,0:21:37.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, is the little idiot even coming?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:37.28,0:21:38.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.19,0:21:39.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now will she show up?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.12,0:21:40.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or will she not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.64,0:21:41.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or will she?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.08,0:21:43.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Or will she not?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.12,0:21:44.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The outcome is vague.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.60,0:21:45.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What, what, what, what, what?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:46.00,0:21:47.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are we sure about this?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:47.38,0:21:48.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we be sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.38,0:21:50.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The princes and the pirates are\Nreally coming right at this rate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:50.78,0:21:52.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rebel army's gonna beat them here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.26,0:21:54.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought those idiots\Nwanted to stop the fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.54,0:21:56.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Shouldn't they at least try to be on time?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.32,0:21:59.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I think it's entirely possible that\Nthey won't make it soon enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.36,0:22:01.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It might even be likely, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:01.24,0:22:04.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,After all, they did lose precious\Ntime when they were in Rain Base.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.14,0:22:05.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? They did?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.96,0:22:06.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All right, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:06.90,0:22:09.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's suppose the rebellion\Ndoes get started first.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.24,0:22:12.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to\Ndo if that does happen?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.40,0:22:14.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We wouldn't have to do anything, would we?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.12,0:22:15.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Think about it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:16.03,0:22:17.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Once the rebellion gets underway,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.28,0:22:19.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,there's nothing even the princess\Nwill be able to do to stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:20.06,0:22:23.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All we need to do is eliminate\Nwhoever we're told to.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.70,0:22:26.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Can't you even manage to figure\Nthat much out on your own?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.72,0:22:29.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It sounds like you're just dying\Nto see some of my dance moves.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:29.94,0:22:31.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just calm down and let it go, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.62,0:22:33.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah! My back! It hurts!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.36,0:22:34.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get over here and massage it, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:34.84,0:22:35.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.75,0:22:39.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're coming now!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:40.78,0:22:41.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Really?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.69,0:22:44.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did you tell us that\Nearlier, you idiot?!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.02,0:22:48.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ducks!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:48.93,0:22:49.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're on ducks!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.56,0:22:51.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're on ducks.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:51.90,0:22:52.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Are you sure?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.04,0:22:54.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do you see anything else?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.84,0:22:56.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems like their number's gone up, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:56.72,0:22:58.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are six of them!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:58.10,0:23:02.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,With Straw Hat out of the way, I thought\Nthere was only supposed to be four left!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.34,0:23:04.22,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Not quite, Miss Merry Christmas.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:04.48,0:23:06.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't you remember what the boss said?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:06.36,0:23:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He told us there's that Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:08.06,0:23:09.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prince guy, too,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.10,0:23:12.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and apparently there's more than one\Nof them, so the numbers do add up.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.66,0:23:13.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just do the math.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.64,0:23:16.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It doesn't matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.92,0:23:18.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phoebe is our only target.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.16,0:23:19.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you so worried about?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:21.12,0:23:22.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.22,0:23:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One, you say Princess Phoebe is\Nthe only one we need to eliminate?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.70,0:23:28.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.10,0:23:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Then how about you take a stab\Nat guessing which one she is?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.10,0:23:36.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're all wearing identical outfits!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:38.52,0:23:42.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even worse, those birds are the\Nquickest in the whole kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:42.12,0:23:43.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Supersonic ducks.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:48.10,0:23:49.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those sneaky rats!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:49.84,0:23:53.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are we supposed to tell\Nwhich one is Phoebe like this?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.32,0:23:55.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just not a fair\Nthing to do, you know!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:05.92,0:24:07.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let them have it down, Mr. Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.08,0:24:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Dodge it!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:16.18,0:24:17.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Miss him!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:17.10,0:24:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those damn birds, they're too fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.74,0:24:22.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two just broke off from the rest!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:22.76,0:24:24.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're splitting up!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:24.08,0:24:26.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like they're planning\Nto go for the south!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.58,0:24:29.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Those two are heading straight\Ntoward the rebel army,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.24,0:24:31.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,which means one of them must be Vivi.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.90,0:24:34.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll go ahead and take care of those two.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.34,0:24:35.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Move it, Mr. Four!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.80,0:24:37.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ooh.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:39.52,0:24:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Special attack, firestorm!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:45.18,0:24:47.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two more of them are\Nbreaking off that way, Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:47.76,0:24:48.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:48.67,0:24:49.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That could be Vivi!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.66,0:24:52.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Seems they're planning to\Ngo in through the west gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.58,0:24:53.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Damn brats.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:54.42,0:24:55.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:59.52,0:25:02.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, let's head for\Nthe southwest gate now!
