Dialogue: 0,0:25:05.52,0:25:09.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So they're going to approach three of\NAlibarna's five gates from the west.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.02,0:25:13.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they're gonna split up and enter\Nthat way, then we'll do the same thing.
