Dialogue: 1,0:25:10.86,0:25:10.90,Captions_v2-207-,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,-830,-830,-850,50)\fnRoboto\fsp0\bord0\c&H596267&\fs65\blur0.9\an8\pos(175.37,768.6)}South
Dialogue: 0,0:25:13.12,0:25:15.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can wipe them out inside the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:16.16,0:25:18.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away from me!
Dialogue: 0,0:25:23.34,0:25:24.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, someone's coming.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:24.60,0:25:25.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, is it the Rebels?
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.08,0:25:30.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, wait, it's the Supersonic\NDuck Squadron. Put them in.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:45.24,0:25:46.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not kidding here.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.00,0:25:49.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way you're\Ngetting away with this.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:50.24,0:25:53.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Four, four, four, four.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:03.40,0:26:06.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much for\Nfollowing us all the way here!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:06.78,0:26:07.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Say what?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:11.74,0:26:12.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:14.02,0:26:16.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, you guys are very good, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:16.48,0:26:18.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's right, I'm the real Princess Beebe!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:18.66,0:26:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you, I mean, what\Nare you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:21.26,0:26:23.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I am the real Princess Beebe!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.08,0:26:28.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I wonder if this is far enough now.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:32.88,0:26:35.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to say it's really entertaining
Dialogue: 0,0:26:35.14,0:26:37.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,how easily you all fail for this.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:37.42,0:26:41.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Now, we can go ahead and\Ntake these silly cloaks off.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:42.70,0:26:45.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Too bad, it looks like\Nyour guess was wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.62,0:26:50.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:57.82,0:26:59.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:02.00,0:27:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to hurry now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:03.60,0:27:05.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Rebel Army is almost to the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:07.32,0:27:08.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:10.80,0:27:11.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Camel!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:12.22,0:27:16.00,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And I recognize you from the\Nship, too, don't I? Sorry!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:17.22,0:27:18.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, come on, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:18.62,0:27:19.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let him have it!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:19.53,0:27:21.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Would you keep quiet over there?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:21.10,0:27:22.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They fooled us.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:22.96,0:27:23.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quite a force.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.90,0:27:24.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know that anymore!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:24.90,0:27:25.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You cleared me!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.28,0:27:29.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It looks like there won't\Nbe any rebellion now.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:29.44,0:27:30.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What did you say?!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:33.88,0:27:36.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I have to stop them at any cost!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.28,0:27:39.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I don't, then all of this\Nstruggling has been for nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.74,0:27:41.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever the cost,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:42.14,0:27:46.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phoebe and her friends must be prevented\Nfrom making contact with the rebel army.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:53.90,0:27:55.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Secure the cannonballs!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:55.44,0:27:57.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't want them rolling away!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.34,0:27:58.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You heard him, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:58.66,0:27:59.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Men your posts!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.84,0:28:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Keep the artillery under control!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:02.50,0:28:04.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The ground is really moving, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.60,0:28:07.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The enemy army is made up\Nof two million angry men.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.64,0:28:10.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the ground shakes\Na little before them.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:10.12,0:28:10.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Stay strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:22.56,0:28:23.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's okay, Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.82,0:28:25.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't have to be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:28.36,0:28:30.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You could get trampled,\Nso just be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:42.46,0:28:43.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, leader.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.72,0:28:45.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please listen to what I have to say.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:45.84,0:28:46.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You must hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:52.76,0:28:53.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everyone listen!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:54.14,0:28:56.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Close your ranks and stay together!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:56.20,0:28:58.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll knock through the\Nguards at the southern gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:58.68,0:29:00.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The rest will fall from there!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:01.04,0:29:03.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not lose arms!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:11.94,0:29:13.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rebel Army, you must stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:13.76,0:29:15.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This fight is pointless!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:15.32,0:29:16.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all a setup!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:19.74,0:29:20.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please slow down!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:21.04,0:29:22.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have got to listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:27.52,0:29:28.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rebel Army stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:34.46,0:29:35.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:35.37,0:29:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Did you see a person standing\Nin front of us just now?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.62,0:29:38.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Person!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:38.60,0:29:40.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That isn't important right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:40.44,0:29:42.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Anomy is already shooting at us!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:46.52,0:29:47.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why did they do that?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.18,0:29:50.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neither side can see anything now!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:52.66,0:29:54.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is the Royal Army thinking?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:56.44,0:29:57.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.76,0:30:00.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I haven't given anyone\Nthe order to open fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:00.56,0:30:02.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not act without my Zeus!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:02.48,0:30:04.70,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sir, I'm terribly sorry about that.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:04.92,0:30:07.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess my hand just slipped. Sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:27.84,0:30:29.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Don't back down! Charge through!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:30.24,0:30:31.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's just a cloud of sand!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:32.06,0:30:33.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:33.24,0:30:34.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You have to stop now!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.26,0:30:36.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fight for the country!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:37.08,0:30:38.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We'll make the king pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:39.58,0:30:40.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:50.38,0:30:51.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leader!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:00.16,0:31:03.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Koza, what is it? Nothing. It's nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:05.84,0:31:07.30,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Was I imagining it?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.46,0:31:22.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Leader?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:24.84,0:31:25.84,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Remember, men!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:26.08,0:31:28.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Today will be our final battle!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:30.36,0:31:31.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait! Listen to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:34.88,0:31:36.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Weezer!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:53.36,0:31:54.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're here!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:55.50,0:31:57.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Get it ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:02.68,0:32:04.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.04,0:32:25.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Save the country!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:25.95,0:32:27.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tag down, Alubarna!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:00.36,0:33:01.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:05.56,0:33:08.26,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Karoo, you shielded me from them.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:11.44,0:33:12.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:13.18,0:33:14.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've come so far.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:15.10,0:33:16.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We've done so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:17.16,0:33:19.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But the rebellion has started.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:19.62,0:33:20.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:21.16,0:33:22.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But I will stop it.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:22.98,0:33:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how many times\Nthey refuse to listen,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:25.88,0:33:28.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No matter how loudly, I have to yell.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:28.14,0:33:32.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We will not let mindless fighting\Ndestroy what we've worked so hard for.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:32.26,0:33:35.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's something I learned\Nwhile I was on board the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:36.00,0:33:37.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Do not ever give up!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:40.64,0:33:41.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Phoebe!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:43.44,0:33:44.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,At last, I found you!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:45.62,0:33:46.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:46.62,0:33:48.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We can still make it in time!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:48.72,0:33:50.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry and hop on! Right.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.70,0:33:51.96,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hang in there, Karoo.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:52.46,0:33:54.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, forget about that bird.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:55.94,0:33:57.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's the matter, Vivi?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:57.32,0:33:59.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, we need to get going now!
Dialogue: 0,0:33:59.22,0:34:00.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hurry it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:04.28,0:34:05.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That... bird?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:09.86,0:34:11.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Let's go, Karoo!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:16.08,0:34:19.16,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on, the rebellion\Nwill only get worse!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:23.56,0:34:25.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp, prove yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.90,0:34:27.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hmm? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:27.68,0:34:29.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You don't believe that it's me?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:31.40,0:34:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:35.80,0:34:36.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:36.71,0:34:37.54,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:37.82,0:34:38.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Eyelash, wake up.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.24,0:34:41.46,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, it's you, Sanji.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:41.70,0:34:42.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Is it morning already?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.14,0:34:44.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:44.40,0:34:46.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So, this is how our fight turned out.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.60,0:34:50.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The part of the mission where we\Nlured them away went really well.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:50.74,0:34:54.28,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But then, well, you see, then\Nit was over in two seconds.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:54.66,0:34:55.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One second each.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:56.36,0:34:58.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You couldn't have held out longer?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:59.84,0:35:01.66,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you doing here anyway?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.24,0:35:03.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Your ducks got me.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:03.42,0:35:05.02,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They came to get some help for you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:05.10,0:35:07.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that aside, you let Mr.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.20,0:35:09.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Two got away, didn't you? Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:14.86,0:35:15.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Listen up.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.77,0:35:18.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That creepy ballerina's\Ntransformations are perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:18.56,0:35:20.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no telling when he might pose as
Dialogue: 0,0:35:20.16,0:35:22.14,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,one of us and make an\Nattempt on Vivi's life.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:22.22,0:35:23.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Does everyone understand?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.94,0:35:27.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And, if you ever feel like one\Nof us is acting suspicious,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:29.56,0:35:32.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,ask them to take off this\Nwrapping and reveal their mark.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:32.50,0:35:35.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If they can't do that,\Nthey're an imposter.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:35.60,0:35:36.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whoa,
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.51,0:35:37.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,having such a well-thought-out plan like
Dialogue: 0,0:35:37.66,0:35:40.34,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,this seems uncharacteristically\Nsmart for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:40.42,0:35:43.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So how can we be sure you\Naren't already an imposter?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:43.52,0:35:44.42,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll stab you!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:44.80,0:35:45.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, that's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:47.00,0:35:48.24,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Woo, definitely Zoro.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:55.08,0:35:56.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm lying.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.14,0:35:57.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're not really Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:59.34,0:36:01.56,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, that's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:03.64,0:36:04.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, really.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.04,0:36:06.48,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You knew how.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:06.56,0:36:09.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought my imitation was perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:10.02,0:36:12.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We even had a helpful report\Nfrom the boss that you all
Dialogue: 0,0:36:12.96,0:36:15.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have the same bandages wrapped\Nup on your arm like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:15.72,0:36:16.98,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,So smart of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:18.46,0:36:19.82,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This isn't good.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.54,0:36:23.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Vivi's in danger.

